en trying to pinch that guy for ages!"^But I'll need to catch him in the act if I want to make an arrest. We can't mess this up."8I want you to go on with whatever Petrel's plan is."`I'll be watching from the side and I'll catch him in the act as soon as he commits a crime!"<Then I'll have all the evidence to build a case on him!"cWe've been trying to pinch the Team Rocket captain for ages, this might finally be our chance!"ZI'll need to catch him in the act if I want to make an arrest. We can't mess this up."�Go on with whatever Petrel's plan is. I'll be watching from the side and I'll catch him in the act as soon as he does something illegal."	\PN!"6Yo! \PN! You're still struggling along back here?"DI'm doing great! I caught a bunch of strong and smart Pokémon!"+Here, let me see what you caught, \PN!"(Hey! Take it easy! You won already!"GWell anyway, I'm off to Vermillion City to get my third gym badge."Smell ya later!"Oh! You bought a bike too!"-Hey, do you want to have a race with me?"BI'll set up the track. First one to complete three laps wins!"BBummer! I was looking forward to having someone to race with!";I just bought this bike from the bike shop over there.",It was expensive, but it's a good bike!"#It was fun racing against you!"II've got some friends over at the Cycling Road who like to race too!"7So, are you ready to try to race against me again?".Alright, let's do this another time then!".Grass and caves handled easily! BIKE SHOP"*Cerulean City: The Floral Lagoon City"Cerulean City Gym";Gym Leader: Misty\nSpecializing in \V[5]-type Pokémon"Meoow!"EHmm... A Pokémon trainer... We have met before. I remember you."!Hmm... A Pokémon trainer..."bI brought back this special flute from my travels. Show me this city's badge and it is yours."BThat's it! That's the city's badge. Here you go, as promised."cThis flute's melody makes Pokémon more likely to appear. Use it to catch plenty of Pokémon..")I shall go now. We might meet again!"DI love coming to this park to relax in the sun with my Pokemon!"AThe nice weather has put me in a good mood. Here, have this!"QYou can use Sunny Day in the field during daytime to make the weather sunny."'\V[25]? Huh, where's your uniform?"-Come over on this side, they'll see you!"<Alright, so this is the rare Pokémon that we're after."�Here's what I'm thinking. I distract the trainer and then you come in and trick the Pokémon into thinking that you're its trainer."LIt should follow you without any problem if you wear a decent disguise."JIt's part Slowbro, so how smart can it be! It should be easy to fool."<That policeman over there could be a problem, though..."&We'll have to be extra careful..."~Okay, I'll wait over here, go get yourself a convincing disguise. Make sure that you look exactly like this Slowbro's trainer!"/Perfect, you found the exact same clothes."HHmm... These clothes look similar, but they're not the right color!"FHmm... No, these clothes won't do. That won't trick the Pokémon."xIt looks like she's wearing some kind of school uniform. You might be able to find something similar at the mart..."5But you're going to need to take off that hat..."]And you even got the same haircut, that's some dedication. It's as if I'm seeing double!"_Alright, time for me to do my part! Wait until she's not looking to go snag that Pokémon."Here I go!"wHmm... I wonder if it'll really be tricked by that haircut though... You can probably get one at the city's hotel."OGo get yourself a convincing disguise to look like this Slowbro's trainer."YYou can probably buy some clothes from the PokéMart and get a haircut at the hotel."}Er-hem. Step right up! You won't believe all of the rare items that we're giving away today for our exclusive promotion!"0Trust me, you won't want to miss any of it!"JYou, young lass! Come over here, I've got just the rare item for you!"4Ughh, why is it so dark? I can't see a thing..."ELECTBRO, ROLLOUT!"jI fused Slowbro with a fast Pokémon to offset its weaknesses! Misty won't stand a chance against me.">You think you can beat me? Pfft, I'd like to see you try!"CThat's the spirit! I'll give you something if you can beat me!"That didn't work!"4No! That's wrong! It's so hard to fuse Pokemon!"WArgh! Electbro is eager to fight, but its Slowbro body won't react to my commands!"8I'll keep my word, here's something for beating me!"5Gotta save your strength for Misty, that's fair!"LI can't believe that the PokéMart is doing giveaways today! How lucky!"3So... Did you really try to steal my Pokémon?"rOh, you were helping the police catch Team Rocket by disguising yourself as one of them? That's really brave!"FTeam Rocket is the future. You should really consider joining us!"GEven though Team Rocket is strong, we still have to stay vigilant!"=There have been reports of criminal activity on Route 5."2We are currently investigating the situation."AI'm sorry, but you're not allowed to go there at the moment."0You! Stop right there! You're under arrest!"You were right!"gIt turns out that Team Rocket were harrassing fishermen to poach the rare Pokémon from the river!"pThanks to your tip, I took one man associated with Team Rocket into custody and he confessed to everything."YThey said they were working with a certain \V[25], but they were nowhere to be seen."LThat's one less criminal off the street. You did a good deed here, kid!"$So, are you ready to battle me?"=Gotta go heal up? Alright, I'll wait for you right here!"Splooh!"xYou're interested in the rare items too? I wouldn't want to distract you from whatever you have going on already..."Brozzzt?"*Elecbro seems hesitant to follow you."*Hey! What do you think you're doing!?"Uh oh..."9This not a wild Pokémon, it's not for you to take!!"This can't be happening!"Heheheh, good job \V[25]!"_I guess the subtle approach isn't your style, huh? You need to work on your acting skills!"<But this works too! Miss, I'll be taking this Pokémon!"$No! You can't do this!\wtnp[10]"$<fs=40>Freeze! Don't 