xt mission..."XHumph... Fine, but I'll have to dock your payout to make up for these wasted balls."Grunts!"Ready, captain!"On your command!"XGrunts, now that you've all received your Pokémon, I have a mission to assign you."�Lately. the Game Corner's supply of TMs has been runnning low. As you know, the Game Corner is vital to finance our operations here in Celadon City..."lNow, it just so happens that the Celadon Department Store is expecting a new shipment of TMs this week."wI will need you to intercept the shipment, then to pose as the delivery person and deliver these fake TMs instead."^Then, we'll keep all of the real TMs to ourselves and they'll be none the wiser. Fuhahah!"XThe shipment is expected to come through the \C[1]Underground Path\C[0] on Route 7."NThis will be the perfect place to intercept it without anyone seeing you."fI will need you three to stay posted there. You'll only get one chance at this, so don't miss it!""Go, now! Don't lose any time!"Understood!"Aye aye, captain!"Yes, captain!"Ready!".\GYou did very well on that last mission."P\GHere are you cuts. I'm very pleased with the way this team is shaping up."\G\PN obtained $10,000"cAnd as a bonus for a job well done, I'll let you each keep one of the TMs that we intercepted.":\PN, you had the hardest job so you can choose first."RKeep up the good work. \V[25], please come and see me when you have a moment."}Grunts, I am disappointed. This was a simple mission that would've been very profitable for us, but you couldn't handle it..."EYou need to take your missions a lot more seriously from now on."Sorry boss..."#We won't disappoint you again!"n\V[25], please come and see me when you have a moment. I have a new mission that I want to assign you to."xGood job intercepting that package. Now all that's left to do is to deliver the counterfeit TMs to the Dept. Store."hI need you to intercept the shipment, then to pose as the delivery person and deliver the fake TMs."\Go wait with the other