off..."GI couldn't find any berries around here. Have you had better luck?"4Stop right there! You're not going any further!"%Shoot. The boss won't like this!"vI couldn't find any berries, and now I lose to a cop! Maybe I'm not cut out to be a Team Rocket member after all."4Is the police academy accepting new applicants?"NAlright team, here's the situation: Team Rocket is raiding Pinkan Island."�They're stealing \C[5]Pinkan Berries\C[0], the fruits that turn the island's Pokémon pink. This is highly illegal, as Pinkan is a protected nature reserve."POur orders are to seize any stolen goods, and to shut down their operation."UEach of you will be assigned a partner Pokémon to help you traverse the island."{You have clearance to catch and fuse Pokémon on the island if necessary. This officer will supply you with gear as needed."~Stay sharp, Team Rocket is dangerous, as is the island. Use this if you need to call in backup to get you out of a tight spot."/Better not waste time. Let's bring 'em in!"DYou're \V[25], aren't you? We've had so many reports about you."#You're as strong as they said."|You're still young, kid. It's not too late to renounce your life of crime. You could have a bright future ahead of you."[It's too late. I tried to stop them, but another thief already picked this bush clean."qAre you proud of yourselves? Are you happy to be destroying this beautiful island for your own selfish gain?"0How did you find me all the way over here?!"&You crooks stole all my Pokémon!"GHahaha! This island is awesome! Why do you not want trainers here?"You're no fun!"HIt doesn't matter if you beat me, I'll go catch more pink Pokémon."DHalt! This is a protected area! I can't let you go any further!"&How could I lose to a mere grunt?"cYou hooligans have no respect for others, always barging in and causing chaos wherever you go!"�It's always the same song and dance with Team Rocket. Petty theft, intimidation, and ridiculous grand schemes we'll thwart again and again! Bahaha!",More Team Rocket! I'll defeat you both!"No, my sweet puppy!"mYou'll pay for this, just you wait. The rest of the force will have you in handcuffs before you know it!"EAre you the reinforcement I called for? Help me fight this thug!"You're doing good, rookie!"�Have you been catching Pokémon on the island? These Pokémon belong in the wild. Please give them to me so I can release them. I'll reward you!";Come back to me if you decide to relase your Pokémon."dThat's a great specimen! Are you sure you want to release it? You won't be able to get it back."wThank you, \V[2] will live a happy life in the wilds of Pinkan Island! Here's a little something for your trouble."<Come back to me if you decide to release your Pokémon."cWait- no. Pinkan Island is a dangerous place, you need to keep at least one Pokémon with you."BIt's a Pinkan Berry bush. There's a ripe berry you can steal!"=It's a bush full of Pinkan Berries. Better keep it safe!"3Are you sure you're on the right side of this?"8You're way too competent to be a cop! What a waste."@It's too bad, you would've made a great Team Rocket member."(Quick, help me defeat this officer!"HI can't believe these dirty cops train attack dogs like that! Phew."3Thanks, \V[25], you saved my hide right there!"fYou'll make better use of this than me. I'll, uhh, hang back while you search for Pinkan Berries."SLeave it to these criminals to sic their vermin on an officer like that! Phew."3Thanks, newbie, you saved my hide right there!"[You'll make better use of this than me. I'll cover you while you look for more grunts."QGo on, find those Pinkan Berries! I'll, uhh, watch your back from over here."SGo on, find the rest of the Team Rocket grunts. I'll cover you from over here."2You are siding with Team Rocket. Switch side?"1You are siding with the police. Switch side?"You're under arrest!"And so are you!"Don't hurt the puppies!"7These canines need more training... Dogs, retreat!"ICan't you see I'm busy here? Whatever, I'll steal 