[["Viridian Forest ahead."~Trainer Tips: Is the game too slow for your liking? You can press the speed-up key in and out of battles to make it go faster!"	\PN!"$It's me, Prof. Oak's assistant!"sI was doing some field work around here and I came across something incredible. You've really got to see this!"cIt seems like there's an outbreak of wild Pokémon with <b>Hidden Abilities</b> on this route!"3I saw one of them in this very patch of grass!"mYou can tell when a route has a Hidden Ability outbreak by the way the wild Pokémon sparkle in battles."QThis is a very rare event. We're lucky to be witnessing it so close to home!"�But I don't expect it to last for a very long time either so you should try to catch one of these rare Pokémon while you still have the chance!"xWell I better get back to the lab and tell the professor about this! Good luck with your Pokémon League challenge!"Route 2" Viridian City - Pewter City"TRAINER TIPS"�If you want to fuse two Pokémon together, the level of the resulting Pokémon will be the average between the two base Pokémon.""Are you going to Pewter City?"9You have to go through Viridian Forest to get there.";It's dark and easy to get lost in there so be careful!"!Fusing Pokémon is the best!"$There's something written here:"JPlease feel free to use the shears on the table!\n-The old woodcutter"_The Diglett Cave is blocked by some weird black substance. It's too solid to pass through.["4Впереди Виридианский Лес."�Совет тренерам: игра кажется слишком медленной? Нажав клавишу ускорения, вы можете ускорить игровой процесс как в бою, так и при ходьбе!"	\PN!"AЭто я, ассистент профессора Оука!"�Я проводил здесь исследования и наткнулся на нечто потрясающее. Ты обязательно должен взглянуть!"�Похоже, на этом маршруте всплеск диких покемонов со <b>Скрытыми способностями</b>!"BЯ видел одного прямо в этой траве!"�Определить всплеск скрытых способностей легко: дикие покемоны в бою мерцают особыми искрами."�Это редчайшее явление. Нам 