 to you."'What?! Who let this child in here?"_No! We cannot afford any distractions right now. Someone take care of this kid right away.";Right, boss. Hey, you! Moon stone guy, come over here!"MPlease... I was just looking for fossils. I don't want any part of this."7You heard the boss, get rid of the kid! Or else..."(Aghh, what did I get myself into..."3I'm so sorry, kid. They're forcing my hands..."Stop! You win!"IBoss! The machine is finally ready. I'm starting the experiment now!"Huh? No... no!"4This wasn't supposed to happen! It shouldn't..."1You better have a good explanation for this."WI was under the impression that this experiment was foolproof, a simple formality."FThe machine must've overheated... I can fix this if you let me..."5Enough! We'll work this out at the headquarters."8Do we have enough Moon Stones for a second attempt?"pYes sir, we've collected every single Moon Stone that was in the cave. It should be more than what we need."�Very well then. I will let you continue your work on this triple fusion machine of yours... But you better not let me down a second time."4I'll make sure this doesn't happen again, boss.":Let's wrap this up and head back to the headquarters."AGood news, \PN! My triple-fusion machine is now operational!"JTeam Rocket's machine was unstable, so I modded it to make it better."ZThis version takes the DNA from 3 Pokémon and combines it to create a clone of them."�It takes a tremendous amount of energy to do so however, so it can only work on powerful Pokémon that have a similar energy profile."PThis triple-fusion machine takes 3 Pokémon and combines them into a clone."Yes"No"Deactivate wild fusions"Activate wild fusions"Log off"Set Intensity[R"8Взять окаменелость Спираль?"3Ну тогда я заберу вот эту."4Взять окаменелость Купол?"HЗдесь лежат рабочие записи Джованни."WПароль к панели управления Проекта 'Слияние':"\C[5]\V[209]"�Давай сюда! Это последний Лунный камень, нужный для запуска установки."IВот так-то лучше. И ст