abrina's pretty tough, but you might still manage to beat her."See ya!"DThere's an invisible Pokémon nearby. I bumped into it earlier!"2Woah! So that invisible Pokémon was Kecleon!"Bi bibii!"YThis Gym used to be the real deal. But they got shut down when Sabrina came to town.":\V[4]  types just can't compete against \V[5] types."4With Giovanni as our leader, we can never fail!")You better keep walking, or else...!"Wahahah! \PN!"UKoichi, the karate master who runs this dojo is an old training partner of mine."9We used to go to Mt. Mortar to crush rocks together."COh hey! I just finished training. Do you want to battle again?"SThat's the spirit! I'll wait for you at the Fighting arena in Vermillion City!"5I saw the Rocket Boss escaping Silph's building."Yes"NoIu;␀�[[":You can't quite make out the markings on the grave...["gВам не удаётся разобрать надписи на могильной плите...;[":You can't quite make out the markings on the grave...Iu;␀�[["yWelcome to the hotel's salon! Here you can change your hairstyle to truly reflect your unique style and personality!"You can also get a special hairstyle if you have the city's badge. Most other cities also have special, exclusive haircuts too!".Hello there, what can I do for you today?"3Oh, I'm sorry but you don't have enough money."Come back anytime!"Gaagaugh!"%Welcome to Saffron City's hotel.":\GIt's 50$ for a room. Would you like to rent a room?":\GThank you very much. I'll prepare the room for you!"\PN slept for a while..."&Your Pokémon are full of energy!" The current time is \V[74]."<Oh, I'm awfully sorry, but you don't have enough money."dFuse a weak Pokémon with a stronger Pokémon. That's the easiest way to raise a weak Pokémon!"Change hairstyle"Dye hair ($1000)"Cancel"Yes"No["�Добро пожаловать в салон отеля! Здесь вы можете сменить причёску, чтобы подчеркнуть свой уникальный стиль!"�Вы также можете сделать особую стрижку, если у вас есть значок города. В большинстве других городов тоже ест