on!"<So, \PN! Have you fused at least 100 kinds of Pokémon?"HAmazing! You have fused \V[126] kinds of Pokémon! Congratulations!"Here you go, as promised!"5That's no good. You've only fused \V[126] times!"=When you fuse 100 kinds, come back for a special outfit."HOh. I see. When you fuse 100 kinds, come back for a special outfit."FThis special outfit truly shows your mastery of the DNA Splicers!" Ohh, what am I going to do?"cTeam Rocket has gone chasing after the legendary birds again after they escaped from Silph Co."eThey were being violent. I had no choice but to tell them where the legendary birds were hiding!"KHumph... You look strong enough. Please, you have to chase after them!"\Hmm... Which of the legendary birds do you think Team Rocket will be going after first?",\V[144]? Yes, yes, it does seem likely."qIn that case, you should head to the Seafoam Islands, on route 20. That's where Articuno is probably hiding."6Here, you'll need this to go deep in the islands."kIn that case, you should head to the Power Plant, on route 10. That's where Zapdos is probably hiding."5Here, you'll need this to enter the power plant."nIn that case, you should head to Mt. Ember in the Sevii Islands. That's where Moltres is probably hiding."IYou can take the ferry just across the street to get to Knot Island."?Show them this pass and they'll let you board it for free."2You'll also need this to go into the volcano."YPlease, I beg you. You have to get there first and protect \V[144] from Team Rocket!"xThey were being violent. I had no choice but to tell them that Moltres went back to Mt. Ember in the Sevii Islands."{They were being violent. I had no choice but to tell them that Articuno went back to the Seafoam Islands, on Route 20!"uThey were being violent. I had no choice but to tell them that Zapdos went back to the Power Plant, on Route 10!":Woah! You saved \V[144]! I knew I could count on you!"1How can I ever repay you? I hope this'll do."`You can take the train to Johto if you