rom the Safari Zone in Kanto?"$\PN handed the Safari Souvenir."4This is great! I feel as if I was really there!"OYou've made me very happy so I want to give you these as a thank you gift!"{It's been my dream to go to the Safari Zone ever since I was a little girl, but I never could afford to make the trip."JThank you so much for bringing me that souvenir from the Safari Zone."hIt's aways been my dream to go and this souvenir is the next best thing. You've made me very happy!"II saw it mommy! The tree stump moved on its own! It's a magic stump!"{No, no, there's no such thing as a magic tree stump. Tree stumps are innanimate objects. They cannot move, my darling."�I'm sorry about that. My daughter went to play in Ilex Forest and she imagined a floating tree stump... And now it's all she'll talk about!"But it's truuuue, mommy!"sPleaaase, miss! Won't you go in the forest and find the tree stump for me? Then mommy will have to believe me!"uPleaaase, mister! Won't you go in the forest and find the tree stump for me? Then mommy will have to believe me!"3YAY! You'll see, mommy, I'm telling the truth!".Children have such a vivid imagination..."-Miss! Did you find the magic tree stump?"/Mister! Did you find the magic tree stump?"VI'm really sorry about this. Darling, stop bothering strangers with your stories."LYAY! It's the magic tree stump! You see I was telling the truth, mommy!"aI don't believe it! Well, this goes to show that children know more than we think sometimes."oThank you for indulging my daughter's request. Here's a little something for you. It's the least I can do."�Children are much more observant than we are. I've been to Ilex Forest dozens of times and I've never seen such a Pokémon before!"3I looooove the magic tree stump! It's so cute!"Yes"No[&"*Здесь заметно пусто."1Ого, ты из региона Канто!"cА ты когда-нибудь бывал в Сафари-Зоне города Фуксия?"�Поехать туда было моей мечтой с самого детства, но я никогда не могла позволить себе такую поездку."�Есл