ironment to get stronger!",You can't beat Irene and go unpunished!"EIsn't this little retreat great? It's our secret little getaway!"$It's a Pokémon egg... Take it?"Obtained a Pokémon egg!"5You have no room in your party to store the egg."#It's an empty Pokémon nest...""You! Thief! Stop right there!"Oh, you're not the thief!"=Sorry for jumping you. I thought you were the egg thief!"jThere have been reports of someone stealing eggs from the Daycare centre so we can't be too cautious."CSay, have you seen any suspicious activity around the daycare?"HVery well then. Stay vigilant and make sure to stay out of trouble!"JYou know the thief?! Well, what are you waiting for? Tell me already!"LDo you know or not? Stop playing around, this is a very serious matter!".Well I certainly appreciate your honesty."sTo tell you the truth, the egg was abandonned anyway. The day-care owners didn't even know where it came from!"9You're probably doing the egg a favor by keeping it."BYou mean he's here right now!? Let's not waste any time then!"<It's noble to try and take the fall for someone else..."6But the truth is, the egg hasn't been stolen yet."tSomeone left us an anonymous tip saying that a thief was operating in the area so I came to have a look around."LIf the thief dares to show his face tonight, I'll catch him in the act!"aThe egg you took was abandonned anyway. The day-care owners have no idea where it came from!"RBut please refrain from taking objects from private properties in the future!"2Thief! Stop right there! You're under arrest!"Huh!? What is going on?"|I didn't do anything! I was just watching the Pokémon I left at the day-care through the window... It's its first day!"[\PN over there just told me that you're the egg thief! \V[1] saw you commit the crime!"I didn't do anythingl!"Save it for the judge!"Yes"No"I know the thief!"... I don't know"It's me ..."!The man behind the day-care![M"�Мы оставили нашего малыша-покемона в яслях. Надеюсь, он подружится с друг