ible!"6You are truly a master of platforming videogames."QThis calls for a celebration! You can have this special Pikachu as a reward!"See ya!"3I wish I had half your talent at videogames..."*It's crawling with tiny Bug Pokémon!";This is Professor Elm's Pokeball. Better not touch it!"5This ball contains Chikorita the grass Pokémon."%Do you want to choose Chikorita?"'\f[\v[4]]This ball contains \V[5]."*\f[\v[4]]Do you want to choose \V[5]?"~I have this idea for a new invention that will be super useful to trainers. It will serve as a map, a phone, and even a radio!"mI'm not sure about what I will call it yet, but I'm thinking something along the lines of Pokémon Gear!"-But don't tell anyone about it just yet!"4This ball contains Cyndaquil the fire Pokémon."%Do you want to choose Cyndaquil?";This is Professor Oak's Pokeball. Better not touch it!"6This ball contains Bulbasaur, the grass Pokémon."%Do you want to choose Bulbasaur?"5This ball contains Totodile, the water Pokémon."$Do you want to choose Totodile?">Hello, my name is Professor Elm. Oh, and you must be \PN!"GMy colleague Professor Oak had some great things to say about you!"As Professor Oak may have told you, I have recently acquired some intel about the whereabouts of the legendary Pokémon Mewtwo."MBut before I tell you about Mewtwo, I need to make sure I can trust you."VI'll tell you all about Mewtwo if you can show me 2 badges from the Johto region."bThat's it! Authentic Johto badges. Professor Oak certainly didn't lie about your credentials!"AYou truly are a Pokémon master. I'm sorry for doubting you!"]Very well. As I was saying, I have some information about the legendary Pokémon Mewtwo."UAll of my research indicated that it is hiding inside of Cerulean Cave in Kanto."uThe cave's entrance is up a Waterfall, so you'll need to teach the HM to one your Pokémon in order to reach it."}The cave's entrance is up a Waterfall, so you'll need to teach this technique to one your Pokémon in order to reach it."vI