 beat me!"HHey, that was a fun battle we had, do you want to have another one?"+Come on Geodude, you can pull through!"~Trainer Tips: Want to listen to your own music while playing the game? You can turn down the game's music in the options menu."/That look you gave me, it's so intriguing!"'Well looks like you beat me again!""You looked at me, didn't you?"I had fun, did you?"+I'm game for a rematch. How about you?"Wow, you're good!"9I'll trade you one of my Pokemon. What do you think?">I'll take any of yours as long as it's at least level 10." So. Which one did you want?"2Sure, which Pokemon are you going to give me?"$You don't want to trade? Aww..." Perfect, let's get started!"&I hope you take care of Spearpod!"%I hope you take care of Zushrew!":Aww shucks! Well let me know if you change your mind!"4I'll take good care of your Pokemon, I promise!"Guaaugh!!""Geodude screamed out in pain.".Do you have some cool Pokemon to show me?"LI'll take any of yours as long as it's at least the same level as mine!"'I hope you take care of Caterkans!"%I hope you take care of Weekans!"$I hope you take care of Ratpie!"^The Pokemon you gave me will become the strongest Pokemon there is, I'll make sure of it!"+Hey, you're a Pokémon trainer, right?"8In that case, you should definitely go fight Brock!"`He's Pewter City's official Gym Leader! It's a must for Pokémon trainers to challenge him!"0Fused Pokémon evolve too. Let me show you!";Say, would you like to trade a Pokemon for my Cateras?"EI'll take any of your Pokemon as long as it's at least level 11!"6Great! So which Pokemon are you going to give me?"(I hope you take care of my Cateras!"?Thanks for the trade, I'll take good care of your Pokemon!"#Some thugs dressed in black..."I didn't see anything"Yes"No"Spearpod"Zushrew"Caterkans (lvl 10)"Weekans (lvl 10)"Ratpie (lvl 10)"Be nice!";Hey, you're not wearing shorts! What's wrong with you?"You lost!"*I always wear shorts, even in winter!"`You can fight other trainers aga