иона!"\Мы раздаём подарки новым претендентам! Держите!"}А теперь посмотрим, хватит ли у вас духу добраться до Уитни! Удачи!";Сколько покемонов вы увидели?"3Хорошо, можете проходить!"8Сколько <b>Пичу</b> вы увидели?">Ладно, я открою ворота для тебя."�Ты уже чемпион, но всё не останавливаешься?! Воистину, я восхищаюсь тобой."�Уитни использует покемонов типа \V[5]. Но не теряй бдительности. Она грозный соперник!"Получи!"�Уитни использует покемонов типа \V[5]. Но не теряй бдительности. Она грозный соперник!;[3"=How many <b>different</b> kinds of Pokémon did you see?"#\C[3]CORRECT! PROCEED FORWARD.""\C[2]WRONG! PREPARE TO FIGHT!" Don't think I'm a pushover!"Oh, no, no, no!"Okay, my turn!"'Darn... I thought you were weak..."6You proved your worth! Go ahead and face Whitney!"LIf you can't answer the quiz, you'll have to fight me to open the gate!"3Give it your best shot, or I'll take you down!"I'm so sorry!"HIn the world of Pokémon, I wonder what's stronger: male or female?"sHi! My name is Whitney. I'm the new Gym Leader here in Goldenrod City. I specialize in \V[5] - type Pokémon."�This is actually my very first battle as a Gym Leader. But don't worry, I can see that you don't have any Johto badges, so I'll go easy on you."EWhat's that? You already have some badges from the Kanto region?">Well then I'm going all out. You better prepare yourself!"YThis is actually my very first battle as a Gym Leader so the stakes are high for me!"4I'm going all out. You better prepare yourself!"<...Waaaaaaah! You're mean! You shouldn't be so serious!"HSniff... I lost my first battle as a Gym Leader... That's not fair!"BAnyway, now I guess I have to give you this badge... Take it!"&You can have this TM too I guess."5\C[3]\PN obtained 3 Premium Wonder Trade ticket!"�So that was the last Johto badge for you, right? I guess I don't feel as bad knowing that the other Gym Leaders lost against you too."[You should go tell... huh, what's his name again? That old professor from Pallet T