xpect you to give it all you got. You can expect the same from me."Shall we begin?";Haarg! I lose?! There is nothing I wish to say to you!"Farewell, then."XYou have made me see the errors of my ways. For that, I am forever grateful to you."d\PN! This place was built for Gym Leaders to gather and have fierce battles against each other."TYou're the League Champion, so of course you're allowed to participate as well!"LYou should go out and try to convince some Gym Leaders to join us here!"DYou might be able to find them out and about around the region."
