[["=\PN! I thought you were never going to catch up with me!"PI haven't ran into that Cynthia lady either... I thought she'd be with you!"mHeh, it doesn't matter. I'm here to catch that powerful Pokémon at the summit and I'll stop at nothing!"gI've been thinking about it and I'm pretty sure that it's a legendary Pokémon. It just has to be!"RAnyway, I don't need your help to catch it. Or anyone else's for that matter!"PBut I could use a warm-up... How about a little fight? For old time's sake!"*Dang! You just keep getting stronger!"Humph... You beat me."CDarn it! I really wanted to be the one to catch this Pokémon!"XBut I have to admit that if anyone's got a chance to capture it, it's gotta be you."`Alright then. You still a have way to go until you reach the peak, so you better take this."YTeach it to one of your Pokémon. It'll allow you to climb up these annoying ledges!"(I'll try to go find Cynthia. Later!["P\PN! А я уж думал, ты меня вовек не догонишь!"zЭту дамочку Синтию я тоже что-то не встретил... Думал, она с тобой!"�Хех, да неважно! Я здесь, чтобы поймать того сверхмощного покемона на вершине, и меня ничто не остановит!"�Я тут прикинул и на все сто уверен: это легендарный покемон. Просто обязан им быть!"�В любом случае, мне не нужна твоя помощь для его поимки. Да и чья-либо ещё!"�А вот разминка мне бы сейчас не помешала... Как насчёт небольшой битвы? По старой памяти!"nЧёрт возьми! Ты становишься сильнее не по дням, а по часам!"#Хмф... Твоя взяла."�Проклятье! Я так надеялся стать тем, кто первым поймает этого покемона!"�Но должен признать: если у кого-то и есть шанс его укротить, так это только у тебя."�Что ж, ладно. Тебе ещё предстоит нелёгкий путь до самого пика, так что лучше возьми это."�Обучи этому одного из своих покемонов. С этим приёмом ты сможешь взбираться по этим дурацким уступам!"HА я попробую разыскать Синтию. Бывай!;["=\PN! I thought you were never going to catch up with me!"PI haven't ran into that Cynthia lady either... I thought she'd be with you!"mHeh, it doesn't matter. I'm here to catch that powerful Pokémon at the summit and I'll stop at nothing!"gI've been thinking about it and I'm pretty sure that it's a legendary Pokémon. It just has to be!"RAnyway, I don't need your help to catch it. Or anyone else's for that matter!"PBut I could use a warm-up... How about a little fight? For old time's sake!"*Dang! You just keep getting stronger!"Humph... You beat me."CDarn it! I really wanted to be the one to catch this Pokémon!"XBut I have to admit that if anyone's got a chance to capture it, it's gotta be you."`Alright then. You still a have way to go until you reach the peak, so you better take this."YTeach it to one of your Pokémon. It'll allow you to climb up these annoying ledges!"(I'll try to go find Cynthia. Later!Iu;␀[[␀[␀;[␀Iu;␀[[␀[␀;[␀Iu;␀[[␀[␀;[␀Iu;␀/[["	\PN!"%\PN! We need to turn back!! Now!"{I rushed to the summit in my haste to see what was up there, but the thing I saw... It was beyond anything I could imagine."MI thought we were prepared to take it on, but we're not. Not even close!"+This thing's powers... It's unnatural."uJust approaching it made my body tremble uncontrollably with fear. I had no choice but to turn back immediately!"[\PN, I'm sorry, but this expedition is over. We'll have to make our way back down now."dI'm serious, \PN. Whatever is out there, it's just too dangerous. I cannot let you any further."It's no use..."aI suppose you have already made up your mind. There's nothing else I can do to convince you."iSo be it... Let me at least make sure that your Pokémon are fully healed before you head out there."2Cynthia healed \PN's Pokémon to full health."]The Pokémon that's out there... It's not natural... I've never seen anything like this."eI know that you've already made up your mind, but I beg you to head back down to safety instead!"wo["	\PN!"W\PN! Нам нужно поворачивать назад!! Немедленно!"Я в спешке бросилась к вершине, желая