orm or another."�You can certainly tell just how enamored they are with this Pokémon just by looking at some of the artworks displayed in this gallery!"nToday's gallery might not feature it, but it's quite obvious when you look at the entirety of their work."t\V[2], \V[3], \V[4], \V[5], and \V[6] are currently the five most prolific artists of all times in this region."?\V[6] has produced \V[19] unique pieces, \V[5] has \V[20].":\V[4] has \V[19] to their name, and \V[3] has \V[20]."?And \V[2] has produced an incredible \V[20] pieces of art!"aThe amount of work and passion that these artists put into their art is truly awe-inspiring!"PFantastic! Well then, which artist do you think we should feature tomorrow?"dExcellent. It's decided then! Tomorrow's exhibition will feature artworks by \C[5]\V[264]\C[0]."bYou can leave it up to us to pick which specific artworks we'll display. Thanks for you help!"5That's all good, you can leave it up to us then!"VAh, yes. You can definitely see the artist's distinctive style in these artworks!"QWelcome! Today's exhibition is all about the artist named \C[5]\V[259]\C[0]."zWe have carefully selected six of their artworks that we feel truly capture the essence of their entire body of work."YAnd we're in luck because \C[5]\V[259]\C[0] themselves has chosen to visit us today!";Feel free to chat them up and have a battle with them!"SWe feature a different artist every day. We hope you enjoy today's exhibition!"*I also wanted to ask you something..."�We actually haven't selected tomorrow's featured artist yet. You're obviously someone with a great eye for art, judging by how frequently I've seen you here in the gallery."AWould you like to help us select tomorrow's featured artist?"sIt's been decided, tomorrow's exhibition will be all about \C[5]\V[264]\C[0]. Thank you so much for your help!"bHey there! I'm \C[5]\V[259]\C[0], I drew all of the artwork that you can see in this gallery."XI heard that they were doing an exhibition about me, 