ных покемонов."jA device used for finding items. If there is a hidden item nearby when it is used, it emits a signal."_It checks for unseen items in the area and makes noise and lights when it finds something."hA tool that can search out Pokémon that are hiding in grass. Its battery is recharged as you walk."|Очень удобная карта региона, которую можно открыть в любое время."�Легендарная флейта, способная мгновенно разбудить любого спящего покемона."WA case for holding coins obtained at the Game Corner. It holds up to 50,000 coins."1A sack used to gather and hold volcanic ash."�Высокоточный оптический прибор от 'Силф Ко', делающий невидимых покемонов зримыми."DA journal that logs all of the quests that you have in progress"'A bottle used for watering plants."fПлюшевая игрушка в виде алольского покемона Мариани."KBoots mounted with a spring. They can be used to jump over small gaps."�Загадочный высокотехнологичный обломок космического корабля пришельцев."nОсобый билет на паром до легендарного Пуп-острова (Navel Rock)."�Пожелтевшая морская карта, указывающая путь к затерянному Острову Дальнего Края."�Устройство для слияния двух покемонов в единый гибридный вид. Одноразовое.";It's a device that can track unusual weather patterns."SAn oval charm said to increase the chance of Eggs being found at the Day Care."KA shiny charm said to increase the chance of finding a Shiny Pokémon."MAn incense that attracts fused wild Pokémon for 50 steps after its use."zБилет первого класса на океанский круизный лайнер 'Святая Анна'."aA cup of coffee made from fresh grinded coffee beans. Restores a Pokémon's HP by 50 points."{A cup of coffee made from espresso and frothed skinny milk. It boosts a Pokémon's speed by two stages when used in battle."�HM07: Водопад (Waterfall). Позволяет подниматься вверх по бурлящим водопадам."nThe user flashes a bright light that cuts the target's accuracy. It can also be used to illuminate caves."�Приготовленные на пару клешни Крабби с чесночным маслом. Восхитительно пахнет!"�Романтическое любовное послание, адресованное девушке из Церулин-Сити."�Лучший из существующих покеболов. Ловит абсолютно любого дикого покемона со 100% успехом."qBorrowing the power of the moon, the user attacks the target. This may also lower the target's Sp. Atk stat."�Садовые ножницы, позволяющие срезать небольшие деревья без применения атаки Cut (Срез)."�Острая кирка, позволяющая разбивать треснувшие валуны без атаки Rock Smash."�Яркий фонарь, освещающий тёмные пещеры без применения атаки Flash (Вспышка)."�Доска для сёрфинга, позволяющая рассекать волны без необходимости обучать покемона Surf."�Компактный прибор для мгновенного перемещения в изученные города без атаки Fly (Полёт)."�Комплект снаряжения для подводного плавания без применения атаки Dive (Погружение)."�Прочная тележка, позволяющая сдвигать тяжёлые валуны без атаки Strength (Сила)."�Используйте этот прибор, чтобы вернуться в последний посещённый Центр покемонов, если вы где-то застряли."�Партия отборных деревянных брусьев и досок для строительства в Вермилионе."�Партия прочных строительных кирпичей для возведения зданий в Вермилионе."zСлужебный значок сотрудника Команды R, обронённый кем-то другим."jA can of beer. It raises your Pokémon's Atk and Spd stats. But it also makes your Pokémon confused."~A small glass of strong liquor. It raises your Pokémon's Sp.Atk and Spd stats. But it also makes your Pokémon confused."�Улучшенный прибор для слияния покемонов. Обеспечивает повышенные характеристики гибрида."ZПамятный сувенир из Зоны Сафари города Фуксия."�A digital encyclopedia that records data on every Pokémon encountered. It can be used in battles to display the opponent Pokémon's type."�Электронная карта-ключ, отпирающая запертые двери в штаб-квартире Силф Ко."EA freshly baked pizza. It could probably be sold for some money."tКлюч от капитанской каюты на океанском лайнере 'Святая Анна'."uA peculiar low capture rate Ball that switches the caught Pokémon gender. It won't work on genderless Pokémon."kA peculiar low capture rate Ball that makes the caught Pokémon gain boosted exp as if it were traded."]A peculiar very low capture rate Ball that unlocks the caught Pokémon's hidden ability."ZA peculiar very low capture rate Ball that infects the caught Pokémon with Pokérus."[A peculiar low capture rate Ball that makes the caught Pokémon sparkle when sent out."uA peculiar extremely low capture rate Ball that makes the caught Pokémon as strong as possible in  a few stats."�Дырявый изношенный кожаный ботинок, выловленный со дна. Мусор, но вдруг кому-то пригодится?"�Бесконечный ДНК-кабель для слияния покемонов. Не тратится при использовании!"�Прибор, распределяющий боевой опыт между всеми покемонами в вашей команде."�Таинственная посылка из магазина Виридиана, предназначенная профессору Оуку."`Ключ от заброшенной электростанции на Маршруте 10."PThis item has been removed from the game. It can be safely sold or deleted."QThis item has been removed from the game. It can be safely sold or deleted.1"�Таинственный камень, принудительно вызывающий эволюцию у любого покемона."�Особый спрей, возвращающий эволюционировавшего покемона к его предыдущей форме."qСтранный камень, меняющий пол покемона на противоположный."=A flag that allows you to forfeit a trainer battle once."jA gem with an essence of fairies. When held, it strengthens the power of a Fairy-type move only once."LA somewhat different Poké Ball that makes a wild Pokémon fall asleep."BA somewhat different Poké Ball that poisons a wild Pokémon."DA somewhat different Poké Ball that paralyzes a wild Pokémon."@A somewhat different Poké Ball that burns a wild Pokémon."BA somewhat different Poké Ball that freezes a wild Pokémon."[A somewhat different Poké Ball that works better on a Pokémon with no status ailment"ZA somewhat different Poké Ball that works better on a Pokémon with a status ailment"LA Poké Ball that makes the caught Pokémon gain 5 levels upon capture."�Прибор для разделения объединённого покемона обратно на два исходных вида."�Полноценный комплексный обед для рядовых бойцов Команды R. Неожиданно съедобно!"�Шедевр высокой кухни от шеф-повара элитного ресторана лайнера «Святая Анна»."AA portable incubator that is used to instantly hatch an egg."rНебольшая петарда. При броске наносит урон дикому покемону."bA pass that allows you to take the Seagallop Ferry from Cinnabar Island to the Sevii Islands."uОпасный ядовитый гриб. Его можно продать за небольшие деньги."�Прибор, распределяющий боевой опыт между всеми покемонами в вашей команде."EA mask that lets you breathe in areas filled with poisonous gas."�Талисман в виде лапки Манки. Гарантирует крит, но снижает точность вдвое.";An Ice Pick that lets you climb vertical walls of ice."OA folding Bicycle that enables much faster movement than a regular bicycle"KA rare gem that is used for making jewelry. It sells for a high price."JA necklace made from a Diamond and Pearls. It sells for a high price."8A ring made out of gold. It sells for a high price."Спинной плавник Сидры, используемый знахарями как редкий ингредиент."TAn ancient, secret medicine. It fully revives all fainted Pokémon in a battle."�Капсула, позволяющая переключить покемона на его вторую стандартную способность."TA pair of magic boots that allow you to walk anywhere by pressing the CTRL key."PThis item has been removed from the game. It can be safely sold or deleted."�Особый эволюционный камень, вызывающий развитие у некоторых видов покемонов."/A mysterious ball. Its powers are unknown."pA ticket required for riding the Saffron Train. It allows you to ride whenever and however much you'd like."Особая капсула, пробуждающая скрытую редкую способность покемона."PThis item has been removed from the game. It can safely be sold or deleted."rСтранный мутагенный ген, таящий в себе непостижимую ярость."iШашка динамита. Обращайтесь с ней предельно аккуратно!"Флейта из чистого лазурита, издающая мистические звуки иных миров."�Особый эволюционный камень, вызывающий развитие у некоторых видов покемонов."�Каменная скрижаль для покемона, усиливающая соответствующие стихийные атаки."uКрошечный изящный медальон, найденный на затонувшем корабле."qМаленькие золотые статуэтки Беллспраута ювелирной работы."bThe user stimulates its brain by thinking bad thoughts. It sharply raises the user's Sp. Atk."_The user switches places with a party Pokémon in waiting, passing along any stat changes."aThe user performs a beautiful dance. It boosts the user's Sp. Atk, Sp. Def, and Speed stats."eA strong wind blows away the foe's obstacles such as Light Screen. It also lowers their evasion."bThe user vigorously performs a mystic, powerful dance that boosts its Attack and Speed stats.":The user scatters bursts of spores that induce sleep."gThe user lays a trap of poison spikes at the foe's feet. They poison foes that switch into battle."QRestoring its own cells, the user restores its own HP by half of its max HP."iThe user lunges at the target at a speed that makes it almost invisible. It is sure to strike first."hA second-turn attack move where critical hits land more easily. It may also make the target flinch."!Like a Pokéball, but black."IA somewhat different Poké Ball that works better on fused Pokémon."{The user steals the target's HP with a kiss. The user's HP is restored by over half of the damage taken by the target."9The user plays rough with the target and attacks it.";An exquisite, red-glowing gem that symbolizes passion."4 A brilliant blue gem that symbolizes honesty. "6 A glistening green gem that symbolizes balance. "O An essential component for linking the PC Storage System to the mainland."cA tasty fruit that grows in tropical regions. It restores the HP of one Pokémon by 30 points."dA banana that was dipped in gold. It can be used repeatedly in battles to restore 50 HP points.">A mysterious badge. Wear it for the ultimate challenge..."nA mysterious stone imbued with the power of truth. It is said to be waiting for the emergence of a hero. "sA mysterious stone imbued with the power of deception. It is said to be waiting for the emergence of a hero. ""FAn emblem that shows the mark of an exceptional Pokémon trainer."DAn emblem that shows the mark of an excellent Pokémon trainer."QAn emblem that shows the mark of the greatest Pokémon trainer of all times."tThe user bounces up high, then drops on the foe on the second turn. It can also be used for jumping over holes."sThe user attacks the target by smashing into it with incredible force. It can also be used to climb up cliffs."UClimbing equipment that can be used to climb up ledges without the use of an HM.">A portable incubator that is used to hatch an egg faster."cA water propelled device that allows you to climb up waterfalls without the use of a Pokémon "�Бесконечный реверсер для разделения слияний. Можно использовать сколько угодно раз."�Бесконечный ДНК-кабель для слияния покемонов. Не тратится при использовании!"_The user swings its body around violently to inflict damage on everything in its vicinity."`This move reduces damage from attacks for five turns. This can be used only in a hailstorm."EThe user damages opposing Pokémon by emitting a powerful flash."kThe user focuses its mind before launching a punch. It will fail if the user is hit before it is used."FThe target is infested and unable to flee for four to five turns."jThe user drains the target's blood. The user's HP is restored by half the damage taken by the target."aStriking opponents repeatedly makes the user's fists harder, raising the user's Attack stat."`The user strikes the target with a quick jolt of electricity. This attack cannot be evaded."KThe user stabs the target with a sharp horn. This attack never misses."VThe target is hit with wings of steel. It may also raise the user's Defense stat."`The user attacks driven by frustration. Power increases if the user's previous move failed."aThe user attacks the target's throat. The target cannot use sound-based moves for two turns."AIt looks just like a regular TM, but it doesn't do anything."_The user shoots boiling hot water at its target. It may also leave the target with a burn."KA cable exuding a mysterious energy. It’s loved by certain Pokémon."hA Pokéball that is completely invisble to the human eye. You shouldn't be able to obtain this item"WA strange mirror that allows you to peak into the Dream World for a brief instant."�Портативный модуль доступа к системе хранения покемонов (ПК) из любого места."lA fossil from a prehistoric Pokémon that once lived on the land. It appears to be part of a large jaw."uПредмет для покемона. This offensive vest raises Sp. Def but prevents the use of status moves."lПредмет для покемона. They protect the holder from weather-related damage and powder."kПредмет для покемона. They protect the holder from effects caused by making contact."iПредмет для покемона. It extends the duration of the terrain caused by the holder."mПредмет для покемона. It boosts Defense on Electric Terrain. It can only be used once."lПредмет для покемона. It boosts Sp. Def on Psychic Terrain. It can only be used once."jПредмет для покемона. It boosts Sp. Def on Misty Terrain. It can only be used once."kПредмет для покемона. It boosts Defense on Grassy Terrain. It can only be used once."wПредмет для покемона. It boosts Sp. Def if hit by a Water-type attack. It can only be used once."uПредмет для покемона. It boosts Attack if hit by an Ice-type attack. It can only be used once."|Предмет для покемона. The holder's Attack and Sp. Atk sharply increase if hit by a move it's weak to."hПредмет для покемона. It boosts Speed when intimidated. It can be used only once."PThis item has been removed from the game. It can safely be sold or deleted."XA mysterious prism that was found in a dark cave. It's unclear what its purpose is."`A mysterious fruit that was found growing in the darkness. It appears to have a faint glow."uA fossil from a prehistoric Pokémon that once lived on the land. It looks like the impression from a skin sail."GCrystalized light that can allow Necrozma to turn into a new form."TAn old tablet that seems like it could be used to decypher an ancient language."�Коллекция ностальгических сувениров с символикой легендарных покемонов."�Удобный спальный мешок, позволяющий отдохнуть и восстановить команду где угодно."^A feather that glows like the moon. It's said to possess the power to dispel nightmares. "bA lunar feather that has been corrupted. It's said to possess the power to cause nightmares. "IA key that unlocks a secret door in the Lavender Town Pokémon House"�Оригинальная униформа рядового Команды Ракета. Позволяет маскироваться среди врагов."fA soft and sweet treat made of fluffy, puffy and whirled cream. It's loved by a certain Pokémon."`A key that operates the elevator in the Team Rocket Hideout. It bears the Team Rocket logo."fA type of Berry that is only found on Pinkan Island. This berry turns Pokémon that eats it pink."[A small whistle that emits a loud, high-pitched noise. It can be used to alert others."OAllows you to quickly switch to the outfit you've marked as your favorite."]A nifty kit that can be used to dye your hats in different colours from the Outfits menu"`A nifty kit that can be used to dye your clothes in different colours from the Outfits menu"VA case that contains mechanical parts of some sort made by the Devon Corporation."uЦелебные споры гигантского лесного гриба из леса Петалбурга."AA handy field sleeping bag that can be used to nap anywhere."jA candy that is packed with energy. If consumed, it grants a Pokémon a small number of Exp. Points. "{Пучок свежих морских водорослей, распространённых в регионе Хоэнн."MWeakens a supereffective Fairy-type attack against the holding Pokémon."EA can of colored spray paint that can be used to paint on walls."&Debug tool for spawning Pokémon."*A small gift box that contains coins.";Some kind of object. You're no