окемаркете хочет увидеть покемона родом из региона Юнова."Фуксия"%Покемон из Калоса"�Путешественник в Покемаркете хочет увидеть покемона родом из региона Калос."Шафран"#Покемон из Алолы"�Путешественник в Покемаркете хочет увидеть покемона родом из региона Алола.""Остров Циннабар"Сбор грибов"�Жительница Пьютера просит принести 3 Маленьких Гриба из леса Виридиан для рагу."Пьютер",Потерянное лекарство"�Мальчик в Пьютере просит найти потерянное Воскрешение. Он обронил его на лавочке в городе."Bug Evolution"�Ловец жуков в Пьютере хочет увидеть полностью развитого покемона-насекомое."Сад нектара"yСтарик просит принести разноцветные цветы для городского сада." Я выбираю тебя!"�Пикачу в Покемаркете потерял официальную кепку Лиги Покемонов. Найдите и отдайте её Пикачу!"/Доисторический янтарь!"�Встретьтесь с учёным в лесу Виридиан для поиска доисторического янтаря."!В роли Купидона"�Парень в Церулине просит передать любовное письмо заводчице Мод около города."%Эксперты по типам"YПобедите всех экспертов по типам в Канто ({1}/{2})";Полевые исследования (Часть 1)"YПомощник профессора Оука просит поймать Абру."Маршрут 24";Полевые исследования (Часть 2)"Помощник профессора Оука просит встретить всех покемонов Маршрута 24.";Полевые исследования (Часть 3)"Помощник профессора Оука просит поймать Бунири с помощью Покерадара."%Рыбалка на башмак"Рыбак просит выловить старый сапог старой удочкой в любом водоёме.""Необычные типы 1"xЖенщина в отеле хочет увидеть покемона Водного/Огненного типа."Seafood Cocktail"�Возьмите клешни Крабби на кухне «Святой Анны» и принесите в отель, пока не остыли."Building Materials"vПринесите деревянные доски из Виридиана и кирпичи из Пьютера."#Официант на воде"�Официант лайнера просит принять заказы в ресторане, пока он ходит за тортом."+Лайнер «Святая Анна»"Sun or Moon"vShow the Pokémon that Eevee evolves when exposed to a Moon or Sun stone to help the scientist with her research."For Whom the Bell Tolls"KRing Lavender Town's bell when the time is right to reveal its secret."Лавендер"Hardboiled"=A lady wants you to give her an egg to make an omelette."A stroll with Eevee!"7Walk Eevee around for a while until it gets tired."Bicycle Race!"YGo meet the Cyclist at the bottom of Route 17 and beat her time up the Cycling Road!"Cycling Road"Lost Pokémon!"%Find the lost Chansey's trainer!"!Cleaning up the Cycling Road">Get rid of all the Pokémon dirtying up the Cycling Road."Bitey Pokémon"iA fisherman wants to know what is the sharp-toothed Pokémon that bit him in the Safari Zone's lake."Shellfish Rescue"SPut all the stranded Shellders back in the water on the route to Crimson City."Crimson City"Fourth Round Rumble"GDefeat Jeanette and her high-level Bellsprout in a Pokémon Battle"Unusual Types 2"LA woman at the hotel wants you to show her a Normal/Ghost-type Pokémon"The Top of the Waterfall"QSomeone wants you to go investigate the top of a waterfall near Crimson City"Lost Puppies"IFind all of the missing Growlithe in the routes around Saffron City."Invisible Pokémon"DFind an invisible Pokémon in the eastern part of Saffron City."Bad to the Bone!"'Find a Rare Bone using Rock Smash."Dancing Queen!"!Dance with the Copycat Girl!"Saffron City (nightclub)" The transformation Pokémon"}The scientist wants you to find some Quick Powder that can sometimes be found with wild Ditto in the mansion's basement."Diamonds and Pearls"8Find a Diamond Necklace to save the man's marriage."Stolen artifact"ARecover a stolen vase from a burglar in the Pokémon Mansion"Safari Souvenir!"<Bring back a souvenir from the Fuchsia City Safari Zone"Голденрод"The Cursed Forest"eA child wants you to find a floating tree stump in Ilex Forest. What could she be talking about?"Undercover police work!"YGo see the police in Goldenrod City to help them with an important police operation."Pinkan Island!"fTeam Rocket is planning a heist on Pinkan Island. You joined forces with the police to stop them!"Defuse the Pinecones!"7Get rid of all the Pineco on Route 31 and Route 30"Вайолет"Find Slowpoke's Tail!"GFind a SlowpokeTail in some flowers, somewhere around Violet City!"Dragon Evolution"]A Dragon Tamer in Blackthorn City wants you to show her a fully-evolved Dragon Pokémon."Блэкторн"Sunken Treasure!"CFind an old memorabilia on a sunken ship near Cinnabar Island."The Largest Carp"aA fisherman wants you to fish up a Magikarp that's exceptionally high-level at Dragon's Den."Ghost Evolution"RA girl in Ecruteak City wants you to show her a fully-evolved Ghost Pokémon."Экрутик"Banana Slamma!"Collect 30 bananas"Kin Island"Fallen Meteor"+Investigate a crater near Bond Bridge."The rarest fish"vA fisherman wants you to show him a Feebas. Apparently they can be fished around the Sevii Islands when it rains."First Contact"8Find the missing pieces of a fallen alien spaceship"Bond Bridge"First Contact (Part 2)"yAsk the sailor at Cinnabar Island's harbour to take you to the uncharted island where the spaceship might be located"Mysterious prisms"`You found a pedestal with a mysterious prism on it. There seems to be room for more prisms.""Башня Покемонов"The long night (Part 1)"A mysterious darkness has shrouded some of the region. Meet Sabrina outside of Saffron City's western gate to investigate."The long night (Part 2)"�The mysterious darkness has expended. Meet Sabrina on top of Celadon City's Dept. Store to figure out the source of the darkness."Route 7"The long night (Part 3)"wFuchsia City appears to be unaffected by the darkness. Go investigate to see if you can find out more information."The long night (Part 4)"The mysterious darkness has expended yet again and strange plants have appeared. Follow the plants to see where they lead."The long night (Part 5)"You found a strange fruit that appears to be related to the mysterious darkness. Go see professor Oak to have it analyzed."Сафари-зона"The long night (Part 6)"�The strange plant you found appears to glow in the mysterious darkness that now covers the entire region. Try to follow the glow to find out the source of the disturbance."Палет Таун"A legendary band (Part 1)"�The singer of a band in Saffron City wants you to help them recruit a drummer. They think they've heard some drumming around Crimson City..."A legendary band (Part 2)"�The drummer from a legendary Pokéband wants you to find its former bandmates. The band manager talked about two former guitarists..."A legendary band (Part 3)"�The drummer from a legendary Pokéband wants you to find its former bandmates. There are rumors about strange music that was heard around the region."A legendary band (Part 4)"HYou assembled the full band! Come watch the show on Saturday night."Mysterious Lunar feathers"�A mysterious entity asked you to collect Lunar Feathers for them. It said that they will come at night to tell you where to look. Whoever that may be..."Visit Dad!"4Go visit your Dad at his Gym in Petalburg Town!"Petalburg City"Catching Tutoring"%Catch a wild Pokémon for Wally."The Pokémon Gym Challenge"GChallenge Roxanne in Rustboro City to obtain your first Gym Badge."Rustboro City"FChallenge Brawly in Dewford Town to obtain your second Gym Badge."Dewford Town"GChallenge Wattson in Mauville City to obtain your third Gym Badge."Mauville City"JChallenge Flannery in Lavaridge Town to obtain your fourth Gym Badge."Lavaridge Town"GChallenge Norman in Petalburg City to obtain your fifth Gym Badge."Petalburg Town"EChallenge Winona in Fortree City to obtain your sixth Gym Badge."Fortree City"MChallenge Tate & Liza in Mossdeep City to obtain your seventh Gym Badge."Mossdeep City"IChallenge Wallace in Sootopolis City to obtain your final Gym Badge."Sootopolis City"Pokémon League Challenge"CCollect all 8 Gym Badges and take part in the Pokémon League!"
