ally dripping with style. It seems it was handmade in Kalos."Lunar Dress"LA whimsical dress that is inspired by the legendary Pokémon Cresselia."Dark Outfit"kA sinister outfit for those who thrive in the darkness. It captures the essence of Dark-type Pokémon."Poison Outfit"sA noxious-looking outfit for those who handle deadly poisons. It captures the essence of Poison-type Pokémon."Delinquent Outfit"bA school uniform turned rebellious, perfect for anyone who wants to show off their wild side."Dragon Outfit"\The extravagant outfit of a conquerer. It captures the essence of Dragon-type Pokémon."Electric Outfit"5A casual outfit themed around the Electric type."Emerald Gear">A floaty jacket inspired by the color scheme of Spinarak."Caph Squad Captain"aA fierce-looking outfit worn by the captain of the Caph Squad, otherwise known as Team Star."Traveller Outfit"<The outfit of a traveler who came from a far-away land."Faux Wrap Dress"bAn elegant, lightweight dress perfect for a day on the beach or a walk through flower fields."Fighting Outfit"zA sportsy outfit that is liked by those who practice martial arts. It captures the essence of Fighting-type Pokémon."Fire Outfit"IA fire-proof outfit that captures the essence of fire-type Pokémon."Floral Dress">A sleeveless dress adorned with a vibrant floral pattern."Flower Jumper"3A jumper suit with a beautiful floral pattern."Flying Outfit"hAn aerodynamic outfit for gliding through the air. It captures the essence of Flying-type Pokémon."Frosted ski outfit"QA comfortable and well insulated ski outfit reminiscent of an ice type moth."Fusion Outfit";A cool, scientific outfit inspired by Pokémon fusion."Ghost Outfit"UA tattered, disheveled ensemble. It captures the essence of Ghost-type Pokémon."Bad Egg Outfit"You shouldn't have this."Goth Hoodie"oA dark, oversized hoodie with a skull emblem, paired with ripped leggings for expressing your inner rebel."Grass Outfit"}A charming outfit that resembles a beautiful flower found deep in the forest. It captures the essence of Grass-Type Pokémon."Ground Outfit"[A rugged cowboy outfit with earthy tones that captures the essence of the Ground type."Gymwear"OForm fitting gym clothes that accentuate a trainer's rippling musculature."Happiny Costume"HA pink outfit with white eggs, made to ressemble a Happiny costume."Royale Outfit A"cA stylish outfit from Kalos. It has a vibrant logo on the back associated with the Z-A Royale."Hex Maniac Dress"AA dark purple vintage dress. It's often worn by Hex Maniacs."Rainbow Outfit"JA vibrant, colorfoul outfit inspired by the legendary Pokémon Ho-Oh."Hoodie"TA cozy hoodie, perfect for a laid-back trainer who likes to keep things casual."Ice Outfit"XA cool winter gear with a chill vibe that captures the essence of ice-type Pokemon."Idol Dress"GA cute, poofy, and sparkly dress typically worn on-stage by idols."Hockey Jersey"JAn outfit themed around the Indigo Ice Beams hockey team. Go Indigos!"Quirky Turtleneck Dress"�A white turtleneck dress paired with unique turquoise bottoms that are a pair of pants and a pair of shoes at the same time. How quirky!"Toxic Idol Coat"VA stylish puffy coat that was popularized by a poison-type Gym leader from Galar."Crystal Classic"AA popular Johtonian outfit worn by aspiring female trainers."Elegant Dress"gAn elegant summer dress with a ribbon at the waist, radiating a sense of grace and sophistication."Yellow School Dress"cA yellow blouse with puffed sleeves and a black skirt, styled as a traditional school uniform."Blue School Dress"aA white blouse with puffed sleeves and a blue skirt, styled as a traditional school uniform."Tank Top & Skirt"OYour favourite blue tank and red skirt that you always wear on adventures!"Long Shirt & Skirt"ZA casual long shirt that's colored like a Pokéball, worn with a black frilled skirt."Red Pinafore"3A bright red pinafore worn over a white shirt."Lycanroc Coat (Hooded)"TAn elaborate, wild ensemble inspired by Lycanroc. This version has the hood up."Lycanroc Coat"VAn elaborate, wild ensemble inspired by Lycanroc. This version has the hood down."Magma Uniform"(The official uniform of Team Magma."Magma Uniform (F)"Maid Uniform"FAn elegant, yet practical uniform suitable for any aspiring maid."Marshweater"=A comfortable sweater designed to look like a Marshtomp."Sapphire Strider"WA sporty, travel-ready outfit that evokes the spirit of a fledgling Hoenn trainer."Fairy Outfit (F)"UA whimsical pastel sweater and skirt that capture the essence of the Fairy type."Fairy Outfit (M)"ZA light pastel sweater and tailored pants that capture the essence of the Fairy type."Mod Dress"�A retro dress from several decades ago. Its square design and go-go boots made it popular with young trainers looking to match their Pokemon."Naranja Academy Outfit"VThe summer uniform worn by students of the prestigious Naranja Academy in Paldea."Normal Outfit"MA brown jacket with a scarf that capture the essence of the Normal-type."Nurse Uniform")Pink nurse scrubs worn by Nurse Joy."Office Worker (F)"HA classy, professional-looking pink business suit and pencil skirt."Office Worker (M)"[A sharp white button-up shirt with a tie that offers a polished and professional look."Bulbasaur Overalls"SA set of overalls themed after a familiar green starter from the Kanto region."Charmander Overalls"TA set of overalls themed after a familiar orange starter from the Kanto region."Squirtle Overalls"RA set of overalls themed after a familiar blue starter from the Kanto region."Pink Pyjamas"<Comfy pink pyjamas with a Poké Ball logo on the shirt."Royale Outfit Z"gA comfortable outfit from Kalos. It has a vibrant logo on the back associated with the Z-A Royale."Pikachu Pyjamas"-Comfy blue pyjamas with a Pikachu print."Pikachu Onesie"1A cozy onesie designed to look like Pikachu."Breeder Outfit"=A comfortable outfit commonly worn by Pokémon Breeders."Venomous Vest (M)"oA striking, brightly colored outfit that is designed to warn those with weak hearts to stay away from you."WA comfortable outfit with bright, striking colors inspired by poison-type Pokemon."Venomous Vest (F)"Police Uniform"HThe official uniform worn by the Kanto and Johto Police Department."Psychic outfit (F)"Ta traditional outfit of healers it captures the essence of Psychic-type pokemon"Psychic outfit (M)"Ta traditional outfit of shamans it captures the essence of Psychic-type pokemon"Gardener Outfit"cAn outfit worn by gardeners. It was popularized by a certain Gym Leader from the Kalos region."Ranger Uniform"MThe uniform worn by those who dedicate their lives to protecting nature."Red jacket and Jeans"LYour favourite red jacket and jeans that you always wear on adventures!"Luxury Suit (Light)"cA sharp, white suit that screams luxury and confidence for trainers who likes to win in style."Luxury Suit (Dark)"bA sharp, dark suit that screams luxury and confidence for trainers who likes to win in style."Team Rocket Uniform (F)"GThe feminine version of the Team Rocket uniform every Grunt wears."White Rocket Uniform (M)"QA white variant of the Team Rocket uniform that every Grunt wears. Right...?"White Rocket Uniform (F)"Team Rocket Uniform (M)"HThe masculine version of the Team Rocket uniform every Grunt wears."Roserade Suit (F)"1A feminine green suit resembling a Roserade."Roserade Suit (M)"2A masculine green suit resembling a Roserade."Primitive Clothes (F)"�An outfit inspired by styles that were popular thousands of years ago. Just wearing it makes you feel like you've gone back to the prehistoric age."Primitive Clothes (M)"Sandshrew Outfit"�A pants and cape set designed with a texture mimicking Sandshrew's hide that allows you to easily blend in with desert environments."Slow Suit"SThe ultimate chill costume, complete with a giant shell chomping on your tail."Sludge Drip"EA sporty outfit inspired by the colors of Alolan Muk and Grimer."Blue Snow Coat (F)"NA warm blue coat, red skirt, leggins and boots, perfect for cold weather."Red Snow Coat (M)"@A warm red coat, jeans and boots, perfect for cold weather."Splicer Outfit"NA comfortable, warm outfit inspired by the look and feel of DNA splicers."Black Shirt & Jeans"BBlack jeans and a black shirt with a Poké Ball on the front."Steel Outfit (F)"hA sturdy jumpsuit giving off a strong, industrial vibe that captures the essence of the Steel type."Steel Outfit (M)"hA rugged jumpsuit giving off a strong, industrial vibe that captures the essence of the Steel type."Street Wear"vAn edgy, elaborate ensemble. It combines style and practically to create a unique vibe only seen on city streets."Summer Dress"ZA light, breezy summer dress, perfect for strolls in sunny fields or along the beach."Aqua Uniform (F)"CThe standard-issue uniform typically worn by Team Aqua grunts."Aqua Uniform (M)"Fiery Torchic Outfit"#An outfit inspired by Torchic."Forest King Cloak"_This cloak makes you feel one with the forests when you put it on. It resembles Trevenant."An outfit that's shockingly comfortable, considering how stylish it is! It captures the essence of Electric-Type Pokémon."Uva Academy Outfit"RThe summer uniform worn by students of the prestigious Uva Academy in Paldea."Veteran Trenchcoat">A heavy black trenchcoat, often worn by Veteran trainers."Ocean Dress"FA stylish dress that captures the essence of Water-type Pokémon."Ocean Robes"TA set of robes themed after the beach. The pearls are made of recycled plastic."Yellow Qipao"SA yellow qipao worn over pants. It's popular with fledgling trainers in Kanto."Youngster Outfit"UAn orange tank top and shorts that's often worn by youngsters around the region."Short Cut with Antenna"wA simple short hairstyle with an antenna that sticks up like a Heracross's, like Aaron of the Sinnoh Elite Four's."	Afro"fA full, fluffy afro that’s big, bold, and impossible to ignore, perfect for making a statement!"Baby Hair"PA single curled strand of hair that makes you look like you were just born."	Bald"OA completely bald look - no hair, no fuss, just pure, unadulterated scalp!"Messy Afro"fA flattened afro with an unkempt, rounded shape, offering a low-maintenance yet distinctive look."Bob Cut"ZA sleek bob cut with chin-length hair that frames the face with a sharp, modern edge."Bowl Cut"fA classic bowl cut with evenly trimmed hair all around, offering a neat and straightforward look."Box Braided Buns"VA half-up, half-down hairstyle featuring cute, poofy buns and elegant box braids."Box Braids"6A cascade of long, elegant, intricade box braids."Braided Buns"ZThis space-inspired hairstyle combines braids and poofy hair into one adorable updo.."Crashing Wave Mane"6A medium-length haircut often sported by surfers."Ruby Spikes"yShort hair with sharp, upward spikes at the front and crown. This style is popular with fledgling trainers in Hoenn."Short, Neat Spikes"rNeatly arranged spikes that look intimidating and disciplined. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Brock."Square-Cut Bangs"dMedium-length hair with messy square-cut bangs. This cut is usually seen on young Bug Catchers."Buzz Cut"PA clean, close-cropped buzz cut for a sharp and low-maintenance appearance."Over-Shoulder Braid".A long braid that goes over the shoulder."Ponytail Spiky Bangs"hLong, beautiful bushy hair tied in a thick ponytail. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Clair."Pointy Pompadour"UA pointy geled pompadour, to make you look like a totally normal academy student"Side Slick Fade"IA short hairstyle popular in Kalos, inspired by poison-type Pokemon."Cornrows"cNeatly braided cornrows that run close to the scalp that create a sleek and intricate pattern."Dancer"VBraids put up in a ponytail. They flow with the rhythm of the music as you dance."Twinleaf Tresses"eA long, half-updo style with blunt bangs. Popular among fledgling trainers in the Sinnoh region."Eevee Tail"@A puffy ponytail that looks just like the tail of an Eevee.