 shape of a Haxorus's jaw. It is sure to intimidate your enemies! "=A friendly Ralts who prefers to lay on top of your head."`A friendly Ralts who prefers to lay on top of your head. It's a different color than usual."dA full, fluffy afro that's big, bold, and impossible to ignore, perfect for making a statement!"NA fuzzy mascot head worn by PokeManiacs. This one looks like a Poochyena!"LA fuzzy mascot head worn by PokeManiacs. This one looks like a Wurmple!"NA fuzzy mascot head worn by PokeManiacs. This one looks like a Zigzagoon!"IA hair bow that resembles a dustox. Favored by poison-type trainers."PA half-up, half-down hairstyle that invokes the security of the steel type.".A hat worn by those who follow the winds."2A high ponytail reminiscent of Lopunny's fur."VA long ponytail with spiky bangs, just like the Paldean Elite Four member Rika's."^A mini posable Charizard doll. You'd need to fuse a Jolizard to get a real one this tiny!"GA mohawk comprised of one giant braid. It's very edgy and stylish!"XA old school hat decorated with an Archen feather. Ideal for long digging sessions."RA pink and black bandana meant to be worn with the Windswept Locks hairstyle."�A pink and black bandana tied with two very long trails in the back. It's designed to catch the wind as you chase Legendary Pokemon."UA practical bun worn by ace trainers. It kind of looks like a Medicham's helmet."GA puffy beret that looks as sweet as the treats pastry chefs make."IA short hairstyle popular in Kalos, inspired by Poison-type Pokemon."XA short hairstyle with mysterious, side-parted bangs like Will of the Elite Four's."aA short unkempt hairstyle with a long bang. Popular with young trainers in the Johto Region."[A short, spiky hairdo. It's been messed up from riding around on a motorcycle all day."KA simple hat made out of straw that is typically worn by Bug Catchers."FA simplistic beanie with a color scheme reminiscent of Dragonite."JA sleek mascot head worn by PokeManiacs. This one looks like a Lotad!"|A slicked-back mullet. It was popular when your parents were young, but it has since started to come back into fashion."]A spiky topknot that's sure to intoxicate all who look upon you onstage as you rock out."WA straw hat with a green ribbon. It keeps the sun and bugs away from bug catchers."bA stylish and practical updo that keeps the hair out of your face while you research Pokemon.".A textured bun tied up high on your head."GA topknot ponytail that flares out into a brilliant plume of hair."NA wild, unkempt hairstyle that resembles the flaming heat of the kitchen."~An afro tied back with a headband to keep flyaway hairs taime. The style was popularized by the Unovan Gym Leader Lenora."6An edgy mohawk inspired by Marshtomp's upper fin."EAn edgy, asymmetrical hairstyle with a highlight in the center. "6An elegant hat that looks just like a Whishcash. "YAn odd mask that makes you look like you just stepped out of a corrupted save file. "kAre these actual Pokémon? Either way, having a Gorebyss and Huntail on your head is quite striking..."Artistic Waves"Balanced Bun"Braided Mohawk"Charizard Plush"Chiming Ribbon"Choice Scarf"Cup of Coffee"Deep Sea Eels"Dragonite Beanie"Dustox Bow"Fisherman's Cap"Fossil Seeker's Hat"Ghostly Headband"Gulpin Beanie"Head Ralts"Head Ralts (Shiny)"LIt's a cute barrette. It's commonly used in Pokémon Musicals overseas."Lava Plume Ponytail"BLong corn rows with accesories, the last in kalosian fashion "?Long, flowing waist-length hair with short, chunky bangs. "0Long, poofy hair popular with young women. "Lotad Mask"Magician's Bob"Marshtomp Mohawk"Medium Flareout"_Medium, smooth hair which curls at its endsides, giving a winged silhouette to your hair.."Messy Spikes"Nice Boat"�Nice boat nice boat nice boat nice boat nice boat nice boat nice boat nice boat nice boat nice boat nice boat nice boat nice boat nice boat nice boat nice boat nice boat"Nuvema Updo"Paldean Ponytail"Pastry Chef's Beret"Pink and 