y the captain of the Caph Squad, otherwise known as Team Star."Traveller Outfit"<The outfit of a traveler who came from a far-away land."Faux Wrap Dress"bAn elegant, lightweight dress perfect for a day on the beach or a walk through flower fields."Fighting Outfit"zA sportsy outfit that is liked by those who practice martial arts. It captures the essence of Fighting-type Pokémon."Fire Outfit"IA fire-proof outfit that captures the essence of fire-type Pokémon."Floral Dress">A sleeveless dress adorned with a vibrant floral pattern."Flower Jumper"3A jumper suit with a beautiful floral pattern."Flying Outfit"hAn aerodynamic outfit for gliding through the air. It captures the essence of Flying-type Pokémon."Frosted ski outfit"QA comfortable and well insulated ski outfit reminiscent of an ice type moth."Fusion Outfit";A cool, scientific outfit inspired by Pokémon fusion."Ghost Outfit"UA tattered, disheveled ensemble. It captures the essence of Ghost-type Pokémon."Bad Egg Outfit"You shouldn't have this."Goth Hoodie"oA dark, oversized hoodie with a skull emblem, paired with ripped leggings for expressing your inner rebel."Grass Outfit"}A charming outfit that resembles a beautiful flower found deep in the forest. It captures the essence of Grass-Type Pokémon."Ground Outfit"[A rugged cowboy outfit with earthy tones that captures the essence of the Ground type."Gymwear"OForm fitting gym clothes that accentuate a trainer's rippling musculature."Happiny Costume"HA pink outfit with white eggs, made to ressemble a Happiny costume."Royale Outfit A"cA stylish outfit from Kalos. It has a vibrant logo on the back associated with the Z-A Royale."Hex Maniac Dress"AA dark purple vintage dress. It's often worn by Hex Maniacs."Rainbow Outfit"JA vibrant, colorfoul outfit inspired by the legendary Pokémon Ho-Oh."Hoodie"TA cozy hoodie, perfect for a laid-back trainer who likes to keep things casual."Ice Outfit"XA cool winter gear with a chill vibe that captures the essence of ice-type Pokemon."Idol Dress"GA cute, poofy, and sparkly dress typically worn on-stage by idols."Hockey Jersey"JAn outfit themed around the Indigo Ice Beams hockey team. Go Indigos!"Quirky Turtleneck Dress"�A white turtleneck dress paired with unique turquoise bottoms that are a pair of pants and a pair of shoes at the same time. How quirky!"Toxic Idol Coat"VA stylish puffy coat that was popularized by a poison-type Gym leader from Galar."Crystal Classic"AA popular Johtonian outfit worn by aspiring female trainers."Elegant Dress"gAn elegant summer dress with a ribbon at the waist, radiating a sense of grace and sophistication."Yellow School Dress"cA yellow blouse with puffed sleeves and a black skirt, styled as a traditional school uniform."Blue School Dress"aA white blouse with puffed sleeves and a blue skirt, styled as a traditional school uniform."Tank Top & Skirt"OYour favourite blue tank and red skirt that you always wear on adventures!"Long Shirt & Skirt"ZA casual long shirt that's colored like a Pokéball, worn with a black frilled skirt."Red Pinafore"3A bright red pinafore worn over a white shirt."Lycanroc Coat (Hooded)"TAn elaborate, wild ensemble inspired by Lycanroc. This version has the hood up."Lycanroc Coat"VAn elaborate, wild ensemble inspired by Lycanroc. This version has the hood down."Magma Uniform"(The official uniform of Team Magma."Magma Uniform (F)"Maid Uniform"FAn elegant, yet practical uniform suitable for any aspiring maid."Marshweater"=A comfortable sweater designed to look like a Marshtomp."Sapphire Strider"WA sporty, travel-ready outfit that evokes the spirit of a fledgling Hoenn trainer."Fairy Outfit (F)"UA whimsical pastel sweater and skirt that capture the essence of the Fairy type."Fairy Outfit (M)"ZA light pastel sweater and tailored pants that capture the essence of the Fairy type."Mod Dress"�A retro dress from several decades ago. Its square design and go-go boots made it popular with young trainers looking to match their Pokemon."Naranja Academy Outfit"VThe summer uniform worn by students of the prestigious Naranja Academy in Paldea."Normal Outfit"MA brown jacket with a scarf that capture the essence of the Normal-type."Nurse Uniform")Pink nurse scrubs worn by Nurse Joy."Office Worker (F)"HA classy, professional-looking pink business suit and pencil skirt."Office Worker (M)"[A sharp white button-up shirt with a tie that offers a polished and professional look."Bulbasaur Overalls"SA set of overalls themed after a familiar green starter from the Kanto region."Charmander Overalls"TA set of overalls themed after a familiar orange starter from the Kanto region."Squirtle Overalls"RA set of overalls themed after a familiar blue starter from the Kanto region."Pink Pyjamas"<Comfy pink pyjamas with a Poké Ball logo on the shirt."Royale Outfit Z"gA comfortable outfit from Kalos. It has a vibrant logo on the back associated with the Z-A Royale."Pikachu Pyjamas"-Comfy blue pyjamas with a Pikachu print."Pikachu Onesie"1A cozy onesie designed to look like Pikachu."Breeder Outfit"=A comfortable outfit commonly worn by Pokémon Breeders."Venomous Vest (M)"oA striking, brightly colored outfit that is designed to warn those with weak hearts to stay away from you."WA comfortable outfit with bright, striking colors inspired by poison-type Pokemon."Venomous Vest (F)"Police Uniform"HThe official uniform worn by the Kanto and Johto Police Department."Psychic outfit (F)"Ta traditional outfit of healers it captures the essence of Psychic-type pokemon"Psychic outfit (M)"Ta traditional outfit of shamans it captures the essence of Psychic-type pokemon"Gardener Outfit"cAn outfit worn by gardeners. It was popularized by a certain Gym Leader from the Kalos region."Ranger Uniform"MThe uniform worn by those who dedicate their lives to protecting nature."Red jacket and Jeans"LYour favourite red jacket and jeans that you always wear on adventures!"Luxury Suit (Light)"cA sharp, w