 hair with sharp, upward spikes at the front and crown. This style is popular with fledgling trainers in Hoenn."Short, Neat Spikes"rNeatly arranged spikes that look intimidating and disciplined. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Brock."Square-Cut Bangs"dMedium-length hair with messy square-cut bangs. This cut is usually seen on young Bug Catchers."Buzz Cut"PA clean, close-cropped buzz cut for a sharp and low-maintenance appearance."Over-Shoulder Braid".A long braid that goes over the shoulder."Ponytail Spiky Bangs"hLong, beautiful bushy hair tied in a thick ponytail. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Clair."Pointy Pompadour"UA pointy geled pompadour, to make you look like a totally normal academy student"Side Slick Fade"IA short hairstyle popular in Kalos, inspired by poison-type Pokemon."Cornrows"cNeatly braided cornrows that run close to the scalp that create a sleek and intricate pattern."Dancer"VBraids put up in a ponytail. They flow with the rhythm of the music as you dance."Twinleaf Tresses"eA long, half-updo style with blunt bangs. Popular among fledgling trainers in the Sinnoh region."Eevee Tail"@A puffy ponytail that looks just like the tail of an Eevee."Neat Backwave"zShort, combed back to hair that give a tidy and professional appearance. This style was popularized by Professor Elm."Emo Bangs"_A styled haircut with long, angled layers and sweeping bangs for a dramatic and edgy look."Bandana Straight Hair"vMedium-length hair that falls straight down around a gray bandana. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Erika."Fade Haircut"gA fade haircut with gradually shorted sides and back, blending seamlessly into longer hair on top."Droopy Bangs"mMedium-length bangs that flow beautifully in the wind. This style was popularized by Gym Leader Falkner."Side-Swept Fringe"KA bold, asymmetrical hairstyle where strands fuse into a stylish wave."Guardian Fringe"OA neat fringe that covers one eye that is styled to look like a Gardevoir."Front Spikes"wSpikes that give an air of smugness and youthful rebellion. The style is popular with fledgling trainers in Kanto."Pomeg Cut"2A cute cut that is styled like a Pomeg berry!"Glorious Bob-cut"~A short, chin-length haircut with a longer strand on the left side. Popular among fledgling trainers in the Galar region."Playhouse Ponytail"rA cute curly ponytail styled just like a Happiny. A wonderfully charming style for any fans of Baby Pokémon."Wild Locks"pThis wild mane of flowing locks is untamable, as if it was haunted. This style is popular with Hex Maniacs."High-bun">A high bun, ideal for keeping your hair out of your face."High-bun Bangs"UA high bun with bangs, ideal for keeping the rest of your hair out of your face."Ponytail"1A high ponytail reminiscent of Lopunny's fur"Puffy High Bun".A textured bun tied up high on your head!"High-pony"oA voluminous high ponytail that shows you're ready for adventure. It's popular with new trainers in Unova!"	Hime"KStraight, shoulder-length hair with blunt bangs and long side strands."Phoenix Crest"eA bold, fiery style featuring a high, curved ponytail resembling the sweeping feathers of Ho-Oh."Demi Bob"-A soft, short bob with a glamorous edge."Short Idol Hair")A short hairstyle with a flowly top."Spiky Ponytail"wSlicked back hair tied in a tight spiky ponytail. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Koga's daughter, Janine."Rocket Wave"_A dramatic, sleek style with ultra-long hair swept back into a high, gravity-defying wave."Quirky Odango Bob"?This quirky, cutesy hairstyle is popular with young girls."Springy Pigtails"0Springy pigtails that somehow defy gravity."Slicked-Back Straight"wSlicked-back medium-length straight hair, in a very traditional cut. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Kurt."Waist-Length Hair">Long, flowing waist-length hair with short, chunky bangs."Wild Upwards Spikes"ZUpwards-facing wild spikes. Very bold! The style was popularized by Elite Four Lance."Two-Toned Slick Back"�A practical, elegant style perfect for conducting business. Or battling with various Pokemon types. This style is modeled after Larry's, who's in the Paldean Elite Four."Puffy Pigtails"\Medium-length hair styled into two puffy pigtails, giving a cheerful and youthful look."Poofy Hair"/Long, poofy hair popular with young women."Shaggy Hair Bangs"WShoulder length shaggy hair that's been kept in check by constantly wearing a hat."Verdant Bob"LA peculiar hairstyle that's meant to resembles the leaves of a Leafeon."Side-Swept Bob"cA smooth bob with side-swept bangs. The style was popularized by the Unovan Gym Leader Lenora."Low Braids w/ Bangs"sLong flowing hair tied in low braids, laid over the shoulders. It's a cute, easy style for traveling trainers."Low-pony"0A low ponytail reminiscent of Lopunny's fur"Voluminous Curls"yLong, wavy hair with a distinctive side part, featuring large curls that frame the face and flow down the shoulders."Lunar Cut"LA bob cut shaped like a crescent moon, with a sleek, curved silhouette."Lupine Cut"9A sleek cut that is reminiscent of a Lycanroc's mane"Peppy Pigtails"JBouncy pigtails with a playful charm that gives off a carefree vibes."Long Teethed Ponytail"lA unique style of ponytail adorned with acessories that look just like the teethed antenna of a Mawile."Sapphire Side Tails"yMedium-length brown hair with a fringe and side-swept bangs. This style is popular with fledgling trainers in Hoenn."Flowing Twin Tails"{Long hair styled into voluminous twin tails with delicate, flowing strands that give off a magical and ethereal appearance."High Twin Tails"{Long hair styled into high, puffy twin tails with straight, side-swept bangs that give off a vibrant and playful look."Bow and Stripes"QA cute hairstyle featuring long twintails with stripey highlights and a bow."Two-Toned Afro"lAn large two-toned afro with a zigzag pattern. A very bold choice, only for the most disco of trainers."Spiky Medium Hair"iMedium-length hair that looks beautiful and youthful. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Misty."Spiky Side Pigtail"aShort, spiky hair with a spiky side ponytail. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Misty."Mod Bob"[Chin-length hairstyle with sharp and geometric lines that was popular a long time ago."Short Mohawk"oA short mohawk with the rest of the head shaved to a buzz cut. It's a style popular with punks and bikers."Elegant Mom Pony"LAn elegant hairstyle popular with moms. It's practical and fashionable!"Messy Mom Bun"KA messy hairstyle typically seen on moms who really deserve a break..."Mudkip Flip"@A spiky, flipped hairstyle inspired by the gills on Mudkip."Mullet".Business in the front, party in the back!"Fork and Knife Cut"0A hairstyle worn by those who love to cook."Short, Shaggy spikes"sShort, shaggy spikes that go well with visor-type hats. The style is popular with fledgling trainers in Unova."Accessorized Corn Rows"ALong corn rows with accesories, the last in kalosian fashion"Shaggy Ponytail"gA long, low ponytail that gives off a mysterious air. The style is popular with trainers in Unova."Joyful Puffs"RNeatly coiled twin buns perched high on each side, radiating care and warmth."Side Joyful Puff"MA single coiled bun perched high on one side, radiating care and warmth."Elegant Waves"YA sophisticated hairstyle that's popular with a lot of trainers with corporate jobs."Pom-Pom Puffs"0Big, bubbly twin puffs bursting with cheer!"Soft Side Bangs"kShort hair with soft, fluffy bangs parted to the sides, often worn by sensitive souls such as artists."Pigtails"[High, bouncy pigtails tied with ribbons, adding a fun and youthful touch to your look."Pixie Cut"nA short, playful pixie cut with closely cropped sides and a bit of length on top for a modern, airy look."Polished Scalp">A completely bald head with some polish to make it shiny!"Pompadour"HA dramatic, swept-back hairstyle with towering volume at the front."Punk Tails"BHigh, wild twin ponytails 